### An empty batch is refused whole.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transactions/batch
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "transactions": []
}

### Stored assessments, newest first.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Filtered. Anything that went to review scoring at least sixty.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments?decision=Review&minScore=60&pageSize=25
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Filtered by date. Both bounds are inclusive and take an offset.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments?from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-30T23:59:59Z
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### First page of two, to get a cursor. Copy nextCursor from the response into the variable below.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments?pageSize=2
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### The page after that one. Refused until a real cursor is pasted in, because the service will not
# accept a cursor it did not issue: silently starting again would page the same records forever.
@cursor = paste-nextCursor-here

GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments?pageSize=2&cursor={{cursor}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Counts by decision, and the rules firing most often.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments/summary
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### One customer, newest first. Paged the same way.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/assessments?pageSize=5
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### A customer with nothing on file. An empty page, not a 404: this service holds no customer
# records of its own, so it cannot tell an unknown customer from a quiet one.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers/CUST-NO-SUCH-0001/assessments
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### One assessment with every rule outcome. Copy an assessmentId from any response above.
@assessmentId = paste-assessmentId-here

GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments/{{assessmentId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### No key. Refused.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments

### A key that was never issued. Refused the same way, and the key is not repeated back.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assessments
X-Api-Key: not-a-key-that-exists-0001
